== the same, by root
root runs plain           : uid 0 0 0 0 | gid 0 0 0 0 | groups  | cap full | AT_SECURE 0 AT_UID 0 AT_EUID 0 AT_GID 0 AT_EGID 0 | dumpable 1
root runs 04755 of 1001   : uid 0 0 0 0 | gid 0 0 0 0 | groups  | cap full | AT_SECURE 0 AT_UID 0 AT_EUID 0 AT_GID 0 AT_EGID 0 | dumpable 1
root runs 06755 of 1001   : uid 0 0 0 0 | gid 0 0 0 0 | groups  | cap full | AT_SECURE 0 AT_UID 0 AT_EUID 0 AT_GID 0 AT_EGID 0 | dumpable 1
== where the bits are not honoured
06755 with no_new_privs   : ended 96
/t/setid/script: uid 1000 1000 1000 1000 | gid 2000 2000 2000 2000 | groups 2999 | cap none | AT_SECURE 0 AT_UID 1000 AT_EUID 1000 AT_GID 2000 AT_EGID 2000 | dumpable 1
06755 of 1001:2001, itself: uid 1000 1000 1000 1000 | gid 2000 2000 2000 2000 | groups 2999 | cap none | AT_SECURE 0 AT_UID 1000 AT_EUID 1000 AT_GID 2000 AT_EGID 2000 | dumpable 1
  and the plain program it runs: uid 1000 1000 1000 1000 | gid 2000 2000 2000 2000 | groups 2999 | cap none | AT_SECURE 0 AT_UID 1000 AT_EUID 1000 AT_GID 2000 AT_EGID 2000 | dumpable 1
